('POL-HC-6278', 'Bimuno (BGOS) Prebiotic, a ß-galacto-oligosaccharide mixture', 'Regular consumption of Bimuno (BGOS) Prebiotic helps to protect against the bad bacteria than can cause the travellers diarrhoea', null, null, 'non_authorised', '14(1)(a)'),
