('POL-HC-6226', 'Barley beta-glucans', 'Barley beta-glucans has been shown to lower/reduce blood cholesterol. High cholesterol is a risk factor in the development of coronary heart disease.', 'Information shall be given to the consumer that the beneficial effect is obtained with a daily intake of 3 g of barley beta-glucan. The claim can be used for foods which provide at least 1 g of barley beta-glucan per quantified portion.', null, 'authorised', '14(1)(a)'),
