('POL-HC-6339', 'Biotin', 'Biotin contributes to the maintenance of normal skin', 'The claim may be used only for food which is at least a source of biotin as referred to in the claim SOURCE OF [NAME OF VITAMIN/S] AND/OR [NAME OF MINERAL/S] as listed in the Annex to Regulation (EC) No 1924/2006.', null, 'authorised', '13(1)'),
