('POL-HC-6244', 'Sugar-free chewing gum', 'Sugar-free chewing gum helps neutralise plaque acids. Plaque acids are a risk factor in the development of dental caries.', 'Information shall be given to the consumer that the beneficial effect is obtained with chewing of 2-3 g of sugar-free chewing gum for 20 minutes, at least three times per day after meals.', null, 'authorised', '14(1)(a)'),
