('POL-HC-6397', 'Lactase enzyme', 'Lactase enzyme improves lactose digestion in individuals who have difficulty digesting lactose', 'The claim may be used only for food supplements, with a minimum dose of 4500 FCC (Food Chemicals Codex) units with instructions to the target population to consume with each lactose containing meal.', 'Information shall also be given to the target population that tolerance to lactose is variable and they should seek advice as to the role of this substance in their diet.', 'authorised', '13(1)'),
