('POL-HC-7308', 'Jerusalum artichoke', 'For pancreas health, fat upper body. Stabilises sugar metabolism, supports pancreas activity and carbohydrate burning so that the desire for sweets and hunger feelings diminish. A sense of satiety is achieved with smaller meals. Jerusalem artichoke also supports the digestive system so that the stomach is calmed, food is well digested and one obtains a light feeling. Inulin together with other Helix Slim substances stabilises insulin secretion in the pancreas. This leads to stabilisation of sugar metabolism, which in turn helps to keep weight under control. Helix Slim brand.', null, null, 'non_authorised', '13(1)'),
