('POL-HC-8146', 'Wheat Dextrin', '- Diet rich in fiber can help you maintain good cardiovascular health. - Dietary fiber helps maintain healthy cholesterol levels to promote overall heart health. - Dietary fiber helps maintain healthy blood pressure to promote overall heart health. -Diets rich in fiber can help promote healthy triglyceride levels.', null, null, 'non_authorised', '13(1)'),
