('POL-NF-00260', 'Codonopsis pilosula', 'Conodopsis modesta Nannf.', 'CZ: Pazvonek Chloupkaty', '[{"part":"Flower, herb and roots","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of flower, herb, and roots of Codonopsis pilosula Nannf. It is a perennial species of flowering plant native to Northeast Asia and Korea.'),
('POL-NF-00263', 'Coix lacryma-jobi', null, null, '[{"part":"Seeds","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of seeds of Coix lacryma-jobi L. A consultation request was submitted to the Estonian authorities under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283. It was concluded that the history of consumption in the EU was established only for food supplements. Therefore, the use of seeds of Coix lacryma-jobi L. is considered not novel in food supplements.'),
('POL-NF-00264', 'Cola nitida', null, 'Kola (BG, DK)', '[{"part":"Seeds","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry only concerns the seeds of Cola nitida (Vent.) Schott & Endl. It belongs to the family Malvacea.'),
