('POL-NF-00078', 'Acer saccharum', 'Acer barbatum f. commune Ashe', 'Sukkerløn (DK)', '[{"part":"Sap","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the sap from Acer saccharum Marshall. It belongs to the plant family Aceraceae .'),
