('POL-NF-00179', 'Bertholletia excelsa', null, 'Brazil nut, Brazil nut tree (EN)', '[{"part":"Seeds","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"All other parts","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the seeds and other parts of Bertholletia excelsa. The Brazil nut ( Bertholletia excelsa ) is a South American tree in the family Lecythidaceae. The seeds are commercially known as Brazil nuts.'),
