('POL-NF-00089', 'Agaricus blazei', null, null, '[{"part":"Fruiting body","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Dehydrated mycelium powder","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'See Agaricus subrufescens Peck The name Agaricus blazei Murill, which was commonly used in the past, refers to a different, non-cultivated mushroom species and should therefore no longer be used. The mushroom that is cultivated is actually Agaricus subrufescens Peck.'),
('POL-NF-00090', 'Agathosma betulina', 'Barosma betulina Bartl. & H.L.Wendl.', 'Zápašnice březová (CZ)', '[{"part":"Leaves","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"},{"part":"Leaves extract","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"Aqueous, non-concentrated extract (herbal infusion) of the leaves","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the leaves; the leaves extract; and aqueous, non-concentrated extract (herbal infusion) of the leaves from Agathosma betulina (P.J.Bergius) Pillans.'),
