('POL-NF-00101', 'Allium ramosum', null, null, '[{"part":"Leaves","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry only concerns the leaves of Allium tuberosum. S ee Allium tuberosum'),
('POL-NF-00102', 'Allium scorodoprasum L.', null, 'Allium scorodoprasum L., Sand leek, rocambole (EN), Skovløg (DK), Schlangen-Launch (DE), Ail rocambole (FR), Skoglök (SE), Alho-de-espanha, alho-rocambole (PT), Ajete, rocambola (ES), Aglio romano (IT), Slangenlook (NL), Käärmeenlaukka (FI), Czosnek wężowy (PL), Ķiploku sīpols (LV), Porinis česnakas (LT), Metslauk (EE), Česnek ořešec (CZ)', '[{"part":"Leaves and bulbs","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the leaves and bulbs from Allium scorodoprasum L.'),
('POL-NF-00103', 'Allium tuberosum', null, 'Kiinansipuli, kiinanruoho-sipuli (FI)', '[{"part":"Leaves","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry only concerns the leaves of Allium tuberosum. Garlic chives or Chinese chives ( Allium tuberosum ) belongs to the plant family Liliaceae (Alliaceae).'),
('POL-NF-00104', 'Allium ursinum', null, 'EN: wild garlic, FR: ail des ours, DE: bärlauch, NL: daslook, DK: ramsløg, ES: ajo de oso, IT: aglio orsino, PT: alho-de-urso, SE: ramslök, FI: karhunlaukka, BG: Левурдата, CZ: česnek medvědí, EE: karulauk, SI: čemaž, SK: cesnak medvedí, RO: usturoi sălbatic, LT: meškinis česnakas, LU: heckeknuewelek, LV: laksis, HU: medvehagyma, PL: czosnek niedźwiedzi', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"},{"part":"Herb","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns Allium ursinum L.'),
('POL-NF-00201', 'Bulbine natalensis', null, null, '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'Bulbine natalensis (Baker) (syn Bulbine latifolia (L.f.) Spreng) belongs to the family, Asphodelaceae . It is locally known as ibhucu (Zulu), rooiwortel (Afrikaans). It is considered a novel food'),
('POL-NF-00202', 'Cajanus cajan', null, 'Ervilha-de-Angola, andú, cuandú, feijão-congo, feijãoguandu (PT)', '[{"part":"Seeds","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The request concerns the use of Cajanus cajan (L.) Millsp. seeds (originated from the pods) , which is considered not novel in food.'),
('POL-NF-00203', 'Cakile maritima Scop.', null, 'EN: sea rocket, DE: europäischer meersenf, FR: roquette de mer, DK: strandsennep, ES: oruga de mar, PT: eruca-marítima, IT: ravastrello, NL: zeeraket, FI: merisinappi, SE: marviol, PL: rukwiel nadmorska, BG: крайморското какиле, CZ: pomořanka přímořská, EE: liiv-merisinep, GR: κακίλη η παράλια', '[{"part":"Aerial parts, leaves and roots","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'Aerial parts , leaves and root of Cakile maritima Scop. are considered as not novel in food supplements.'),
('POL-NF-00204', 'Calendula officinalis L.', null, 'EN: pot marigold, DE: ringelblume, FR: souci officinal, DK: havemorgenfrue, ES: botón de oro, IT: calendola, PT: calêndula, NL: goudsbloem, FI: tarhakehäkukka, SE: ringblomma, PL: nagietek lekarski, CZ: měsíček lékařský, EE: harilik saialill, GR: καλέντουλα η φαρμακευτική, LV: kliņģerīte, LT: vaistinė medetka, RO: gălbenele, SK: nechtík lekársky, SI: vrtni ognjič, HU: orvosi körömvirág', '[{"part":"Herb, flowers, petals","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the herb, flowers and petals of Calendula officinalis L.'),
