('POL-NF-00226', 'Celastrus orbiculatus', null, null, '[{"part":"Fruit","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of fruit of Celastrus orbiculatus Thunb. It belongs to the family of Celastraceae. The request was submitted to the Estonian Authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283. The outcome is also published on the following Commission''s link https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en'),
