('POL-NF-00128', 'Angelica archangelica L.', 'Angelica archangelica subsp. norwegica (Rupr.) Nordh.', 'Angelica, Garden Angelica, Holy Ghost, Wild Celery, Norwegian angelica (EN), Grote Engelwortel, engelwortel (NL), Väinönputki (FI), Echter Engelwurz (DE), Angélica, hierba del Espíritu Santo (ES), Blag buz (BG), Fjeldkvan (DK), Archangélique, angélique vraie, Saint-esprit, angélique (FR), Agelici (GR), Ætihvönn (IS), Fjellkvann, Kvann (NO), Angélica dos jardins, angélica da Boémia, erva do Espirito Santo (PT), Dziegiel lesny (PO), Fjällkvanne (SE), Archangelica officinalis', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"},{"part":"Leaves, petiole and stem","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the different parts of Angelica archangelica L.'),
