('POL-NF-00454', 'Laminaria longicruris', null, 'listownica długa (PL)', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'Marine algae which belongs to the Laminariaceae Family and which is normally restricted to subtidal habitats.'),
('POL-NF-00456', 'Lamium album L.', null, 'EN: white nettle, DE: weiße taubnessel, FR: lamier blanc, DK: døvnælde, NL: witte dovenetel, ES: ortiga blanca, IT: falsa ortica bianca, PT: urtiga-branca, FI: valkopeippi, SE: vitplister, PL: jasnota biała, CZ: hluchavka bílá, EE: valge iminõges, LV: baltā panātre, LT: baltažiedė notrelė, RO: urzica moartă alba, SK: hluchavka biela, HU: fehér árvacsalán', '[{"part":"Aerial parts","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Other plant parts","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns Lamium album L.'),
('POL-NF-00457', 'Lamium galaeobdolon L.', null, 'EN: yellow archangel, DE: gewöhnliche goldnessel, FR: lamier jaune, DK: almindelig guldnælde, NL: gele dovenetel, ES: ortiga muerta amarilla, IT: falsa Ortica gialla, FI: keltapeippi, SE: gulplister, PL: gajowiec żółty, BG: жълта мъртва коприва, CZ: pitulník žlutý, EE: koldnõges, LT: geltonžiedis šalmutis, RO: urzică moartă-galbenă, HU: erdei sárgaárvacsalán', '[{"part":"Aerial parts","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the aerial parts of Lamium galaeobdolon L.'),
('POL-NF-00458', 'Lamium purpureum L.', null, 'EN: red dead-nettle, DE: purpurrote taubnessel, FR: lamier pourpre, DK: rød tvetand, NL: paarse dovenetel, ES: ortiga muerta purpúrea, PT: lâmio-roxo, IT: falsa ortica purpurea, PL: jasnota purpurowa, SE: rödplister, FI: punapeippi, CZ: hluchavka nachová, EE: verve iminõges, LT: raudonžiedė notrelė, RO: sugel, SK: hluchavka purpurová, HU: piros árvacsalán', '[{"part":"Aerial parts","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the aerial parts of Lamium purpureum L.'),
('POL-NF-00459', 'Langermannia gigantea', 'Calvatia gigantea (Batsch ex Pers.) Lloyd, Lycoperdon gigantea. The preferred name is however Langermannia gigantea', 'reuzenbovist (NL)', '[{"part":"Fruiting body","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry only concerns the fruiting body of Langermannia gigantea.Langermannia gigantean (Batsch ex Pers.) Rostk is a mushroom belonging to the Agaricaceae family.'),
