('POL-NF-00551', 'Origanum vulgare', 'Origanum americanum Raf.', 'Mäkimeirami, oregano (FI)', '[{"part":"Essential oil","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"},{"part":"Aerial parts","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the aerial parts of and the essential oil from Origanum vulgare L..'),
