('POL-NF-00468', 'Lemna minor', null, 'Common duckweed (EN)', '[{"part":"Extracts on the basis of wine and bee honey prepared with Lemna minor","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns extracts on the basis of wine and bee honey prepared with Lemna minor L . It is an aquatic plant belonging to the family of Lemniaceae.'),
('POL-NF-00469', 'Lentinula edodes', null, 'Houževnatec jedlý (CZ)', '[{"part":"Fruiting body and aqueous extract powder","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Dehydrated mycelium powder.","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"Mycelial extract","status":"AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the fruiting body, dehydrated mycelium powder and mycelial extract of Lentinula edodes (Berk.) Pegler. A request was submitted to the Finish competent authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283 regarding the novel food status of an extract powder from the fruiting body of Lentinula edodes (Berk.) Pegler. using a combination of ultrasonic-assisted extraction (UAE) and traditional hot-water extraction. It was concluded that it was not novel. Another request was submi'),
('POL-NF-00562', 'Paeonia officinalis', null, 'Common peony (EN)', '[{"part":"Flowers","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the flowers of Paeonia officinalis Thunb. It belongs to the family Paeoniaceae .'),
