('POL-NF-05982', 'Agaricus bisporus', 'Agaricus hortensis (Cooke) Imai; Agaricus hortensis (Cooke) Pilát', 'Champignon de Paris (FR), (Parijse) champignon (NL), Zucht-Champignon, Weißer Champignon, (DE), champiñón común, champiñón de París (ES)', '[{"part":"Selenium and ‘Vitamin B12 enriched mushrooms (fruiting body of Agaricus bisporus)","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Vitamin D2 mushroom (Agaricus bisporus) powder","status":"AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"UV-treated mushrooms (Agaricus bisporus)","status":"AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"Fruiting body","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the fruiting body, UV-treated mushrooms, Vitamin D2 mushroom powder and the use of Selenium and ‘Vitamin B12 enriched mushrooms (Agaricus bisporus). The request was submitted to the Irish Authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283. The outcome is also published on the following Commission''s link https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en under the entry Agaricus bisporus (Selenium and Vitamin B12 mushroom)'),
('POL-NF-00370', 'Galium odoratum L.', null, 'EN: sweet woodruff, DE: waldmeister, FR: gaillet odorant, DK: skovmærke, NL: lievevrouwebedstro, ES: asperilla olorosa, PT: aspérula-odorífera, IT: stellina odorosa, SE: myskmadra, FI: tuoksumatara, EE: lõhnav madar, PL: przytulia wonna, BG: лазаркинята, CZ: svízel vonný, LV: smaržīgā madara, LT: kvapusis lipikas, RO: vinarita, SK: lipkavec marinkový, SI: dišeča perla, HU: szagos müge', '[{"part":"Leaves and flowers","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Other aerial parts","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the leaves, flowers and other aerial parts from Galium odoratum L.'),
('POL-NF-00371', 'Galium verum L.', null, null, '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'Common names EN: lady’s bedstraw, DE: echte labkraut, FR: caille-lait jaune, DK: gul snerre, NL: geel walstro, ES: cuajaleche, IT: caglio zolfino, FI: keltamatara, SE: gulmåra, PL: przytulia właściwa, CZ: svízel syřišťový, EE: hobumadar, LV: īstā madara, LT: tikrasis lipikas, RO: sânziana, SK: lipkavec pravý, SI: prava Lakota, HU: tejoltó galaj Galium verum L. is considered as not novel in food supplements.'),
('POL-NF-00372', 'Ganoderma lucidum', null, 'Reishi (EN)', '[{"part":"Dehydrated mycelium powder","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"Fruiting body and aqueous extract powder","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of fruit bodies and dehydrated mycelium powder of Ganoderma lucidum. Ganoderma lucidum belongs to the Basidiomycotina class of fungi. A request was submitted to the Finish competent authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283 regarding the novel food status of an extract powder from the fruiting body of Ganoderma lucidum using a combination of ultrasonic-assisted extraction (UAE) and traditional hot-water extraction. It was concluded that it was not novel. A'),
('POL-NF-00374', 'Garcinia cambogia', 'Garcinia gummi-gutta (L.) Roxb', 'CitrinGambooge', '[{"part":"Fruit","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of fruit of Garcinia cambogia Desr. . Exotic fruit (Clusiaceae Family) grown in South India, has been used to impart a distinctive sour flavour to Indian cooking.'),
('POL-NF-00375', 'Garcinia mangostana', null, 'Mangosteen (EN)', '[{"part":"Fruit (berry)","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Fruit peel","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of fruit and peel of Garcinia × mangostana L.. Plant belonging to the Guttiferae Family. The edible part of mangosteen is the fruit (berry).'),
('POL-NF-00376', 'Gentianella alborosea', null, 'Hercampuri', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"SUBJECT_TO_A_CONSULTATION_REQUEST"}]'::jsonb, 'Plant belonging to the Gentianaceae Family native to Peruvian Andes.'),
