('POL-NF-00476', 'Liposomal vitamin C', null, 'Liposomal vitamin C', '[{"part":"Substance/extract/preparation","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns Liposomal vitamin C. According to the conclusion reached by the Polish competent authorities (Główny Inspektor Sanitarny-Chief Sanitary Inspector) in response to a request submitted pursuant to the requirements of Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2018/456 (https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en) on the procedural steps of the consultation process for determination of novel food status, Liposomal vitamin C is not novel in food.'),
