('POL-NF-00413', 'Hydro-alcoholic extract of Porphyra yezoensis', null, null, '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The request concerns the hydro-alcoholic extract of porphyra yezoensis (Ueda)stabilized in glycerin intended to be used in food supplements. According to the conclusion reached by the Belgian competent authorities in response to a request submitted pursuant to the requirements of Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2018/456 (https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en) on the procedural steps of the consultation process for determination of novel food status, hydro-al'),
('POL-NF-00509', 'Monarda didyma', 'Monarda coccinea Michx.', 'Scarlet beebalm, Punaväriminttu (FI)', '[{"part":"Infusion of flowers","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Aerial parts","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the aerial parts of Monarda didym a L.'),
