('POL-NF-00432', 'Ipomoea batatas', null, 'Sweet potato (EN)', '[{"part":"Roots, tuber and leaves","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the roots, tubers and leaves of Ipomoea batatas. A request was submitted to the Italian competent authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283 regarding the novel food status of concentrated preparation (paste) of Dioscorea alata L. (Ube) / Ipomoea batatas L. (Purple Sweet Potato ) in a 70:30 weight ratio. It was concluded that it was not novel. Another request was submitted to the Italian competent authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283 regarding the'),
