('POL-NF-00448', 'Lactarius torminosus', null, 'Woolly Milk-cap, bearded milkcap (EN)', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'Lactarius torminosus is a large basidiomycete fungus in the family Russulaceae and genus Lactarius . It is found in North Africa, northern Asia, Europe, and North America'),
