('POL-NF-00771', 'Vaccinium uliginosum', null, 'Bog bilberry, Northern bilberry, Bog whortleberry, Bilberry, Tundra Bilberry (EN)', '[{"part":"Fruit of Vaccinium uliginosum","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the fruit (berries) of Vaccinium uliginosum . Vaccinium uliginosum belongs to the flowering plant family Ericaceae.'),
