('POL-NF-00787', 'Xanthoparmelia scabrosa', null, 'Sigra', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'A lichen that belongs to the Parmeliaceae Family. It is a yellow-green plant which is common on asphalt, also on rock, soil, glass and sometimes on bark.'),
