('POL-NF-00792', 'Zeolite', null, 'volcanic rock, volcanic sand; Cleanolina, Vulkansand, Clinoptilolith (DE), ziemia wulkaniczna (PL),', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'Zeolites are porous minerals with high absorbency and ion-exchange capacity. There are several synthetic or natural occurring species of zeolites, being clinoptilolite the most widespread and studied'),
