('POL-NF-00695', 'Silybum marianum', 'Carduus marianus L.', 'EN: Milk thistle', '[{"part":"Seed oil","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Aerial parts and acetone-extract from the fruit (silymarin 70-80%)","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the aerial parts and seed oil of Silybum marianum. It also refers to an extract from the fruit of Silybum marianum extracted with acetone which contains 70 to 80% silymarin.'),
