('POL-NF-00698', 'Siraitia grosvenorii', 'Momordica grosvenorii Swingle', 'balzsamkörte fajta (HU)', '[{"part":"Fruit","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"Monk fruit decoction","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the fruits of Siraitia grosvenorii . It belongs to the Cucurbitaceae Family. Additionally, according to the conclusion reached by the Irish competent authorities (FSAI) in response to a request submitted pursuant to the requirements of Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2018/456 (https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en) on the procedural steps of the consultation process for determination of novel food status, monk fruit decoctions are consider'),
