('POL-NF-00701', 'Sodium hyaluronate produced by fermentation process', null, null, '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns sodium hyaluronate produced by fermentation process . According to the conclusion reached by the Ministry of Agriculture of the Czech Republic, in response to the request submitted pursuant to the requirements of Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2018/456 ( https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en ) on the procedural steps of the consultation process for determination of novel food status, a sodium hyaluronate produced by fermentation process i'),
('POL-NF-00702', 'Sodium/magnesium/calcium salts of betahydroxybutyrate', 'Sodium/Magnesium/calcium 3-hydroxybutyrate', null, '[{"part":"Substance","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the sodium/magnesium/calcium salts of 3-hydroxybutyrate.'),
