('POL-NF-00705', 'Solanum lycopersicum', null, null, '[{"part":"oleoresin extract of dry Solanum lycopersicum L","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"y-product of plant origin obtained from the extraction of lycopene from tomato","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The requests concern the use of tomato oleoresin extract of dry yellow tomato ( Solanum lycopersicum ) (Lumenato 10%) and a by-product of plant origin obtained from the extraction of lycopene from tomato The first request was submitted to the Irish authorities under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283. It was concluded that the history of consumption in the EU was not established. Therefore, tomato oleoresin extract of dry yellow tomato ( Solanum lycopersicum ) (Lumenato 10%) is considered a '),
