('POL-NF-00727', 'Suaeda maritima L.', null, null, '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'Common names EN: herbaceous seepweed, DE: strand-sode, FR: soude maritime, DK: strandgåsefod, NL: klein schorrenkruid, ES: almajo, IT: suaeda marittima, SE: saltört, FI: pikkukilokki, EE: rand-soodahein, PL: sodówka nadmorska The whole plant is considered as novel.'),
