('POL-NF-00731', 'Syringa vulgaris', null, 'EN: lilac, DE: gemeiner flieder, FR: lilas commun, DK: almindelig syren, NL: sering, ES: lila común, IT: lillà comune, FI: pihasyreeni, SE: syren, PL: lilak pospolity, CZ: šeřík obecný, EE: harilik sirel, GR: πασχαλιά, LT: paprastoji alyva, RO: liliacul, SK: orgován obyčajný, SI: španski bezeg, HU: közönséges orgona', '[{"part":"Aerial part, bark, flowers, leaves, fruits and gemma","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the aerial part, bark, flowers, leaves, fruits and gemma of Syringa vulgaris L.'),
('POL-NF-00732', 'Syzygium jambos', null, 'EN: Rose apple, jambos, Malabar Plum, champakka, chom pu, chom-phu', '[{"part":"Fruits (botanically berries)","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of fruits (botanically berry) of Syzygium jambos .'),
