('POL-NF-10053', 'Bovine pancreas', null, 'pancréas bovin (FR); Rinder-Bauchspeicheldrüse (DE)', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the animal organ, bovine pancreas.'),
