('POL-NF-00681', 'Salvia hispanica', 'Kiosmina hispanica (L.) Raf., Salvia chia Colla, Salvia chia Sessé & Moc. nom. illeg., Salvia neohispanica Briq. nom. illeg., Salvia prysmatica Cav., Salvia schiedeana Stapf, Salvia tetragona Moench', 'Chia (DE)', '[{"part":"Seed, seed oil and partially defatted seed powder","status":"AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the seeds, seed oil and partially defatted seed powders of Salvia hispanica L. Chia ( Salvia hispanica ) is a summer annual herbaceous plant belonging to the Labiatae Family.'),
