('POL-NF-00287', 'Creatine Citrate', null, 'Citrato de creatina (PT)', '[{"part":"Creatine citrate","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'Creatine [N-(aminoiminomethyl-N-methyl glycine)] occurs naturally in foods such as meat, fish and other animal products. It may also be formed endogenously in the liver, kidney and pancreas from the amino acids Gly, Arg and Met.'),
