('POL-NF-00262', 'Coffea sp.', null, 'FI: Kahvi', '[{"part":"Seeds of Coffea spp.","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"Infusion from coffee leaves of Coffea arabica L. and/or Coffea canephora Pierre ex A. Froehne","status":"AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"Dried cherry pulp (cascara) and its infusion from Coffea arabica L. and/or Coffea canephora Pierre ex A.Froehner","status":"AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"Roasted silver skin of coffee beans","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"},{"part":"Coffee (Coffea arabica) grounds oil extract","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the roasted or unroasted seeds of Coffea spp ., and the non-selective infusion from them (coffee beverage). It also concerns the leaves and dried cherry pulp (cascara) of Coffea arabica L. and/or Coffea canephora Pierre ex A. Froehner. Infusion from coffee leaves of Coffea arabica L. and/or Coffea canephora Pierre ex A. Froehne, and dried unroasted coffee cherry pulp (cascara) of Coffea arabica L. and/or Coffea canephora Pierre ex A.Froehner and its infusion are authorised nov'),
('POL-NF-00444', 'Lablab purpureus', 'Hyacinth bean, bonavist bean, lablab bean, Indian bean, Egyptian bean (EN), Lablab (BG), Hjelmbønne (DK, NO), Dolique d’Egypte, dolique lab-lab (FR), Koeliboon (NL), Hyasinttipapu (FI), Helmbohne, Lablabbohne (DE), Hjálmbaun (IS), Cucurbita lagenaria, zucca lagenaria (IT), Feijoeiro-bravo, feijão-cutelinho (PT), Fasolnik egipski (PL), Fríjol jacinto, fríjol dólico, judía de Egipto (ES), Hjälmböna (SE), Dolichos lablab, Dolichos purpureus', 'Hyacinth bean, bonavist bean, lablab bean, Indian bean, Egyptian bean (EN)', '[{"part":"Seeds (derived from the pod)","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry only concerns the seeds (derived from the pod) of Lablab purpureus. Lablab purpureus is a species of bean in the family Fabaceae (Leguminosae, subfam. Papilionoideae), which is widespread as a food crop throughout the tropics, especially in Africa, India, and Indonesia.'),
('POL-NF-00462', 'Laurus nobilis', 'Laurus angusta Raf.', 'Laurel europeo, laurel de cocina (ES)', '[{"part":"Flowers, fruit and essential oil","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"},{"part":"Leaves","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the leaves, flowers, fruits of and essential oil from Laurel nobilis L.. It is a plant belonging to the Lauraceae family.'),
