('POL-NF-09741', 'Eucheuma denticulatum', 'Fucus denticulatus N.L.Burman 1768, Fucus muricatus S.G.Gmelin 1768, Fucus spinosus Linnaeus 1771, Ulva papillosa Linnaeus 1771, Gigartina muricata (S.G.Gmelin) J.V.Lamouroux 1813, Chondria spinosa C.Agardh 1817, Ceramium spinosum (Linnaeus) Ruchinger 1818, Sphaerococcus spinosus C.Agardh 1822, Gigartina spinosa Greville 1830, Rhynchococcus spinosus (Linnaeus) Kützing 1843, Eucheuma spinosum J.Agardh 1847, Grateloupia opposita Kützing 1867, Eucheuma muricatum (S.G.Gmelin) Weber Bosse 1928', null, '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of Eucheuma denticulatum (N.L.Burman) Collins & Hervey 1917'),
('POL-NF-17401', 'Ferula assa-foetida L.', null, 'Asafoetida', '[{"part":"Oleo-gum-resin (exudate) from the root","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns asafoetida ( Ferula assa-foetida L. ), consisting of the natural oleo-gum-resin (exudate) obtained by incision of the root of the plant. A request concerning asafoetida ( Ferula assa-foetida L. ) were submitted to the Czech competent authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283. The outcome is also published on the following Commission''s link https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en'),
('POL-NF-09861', 'Activated charcoal', 'Vegetable active coal, active coal', 'EN: Vegetable coal, activated charcoal', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of activated charcoal based on vegetable origin. The history of consumption (for purposes other than those covered by Regulation (EC) No 1333/2008 on food additives) has been demonstrated for products meeting the same specification as E-153 in Regulation (EC) No 231/2012.'),
('POL-NF-09661', 'Neopyropia leucosticta', 'Porphyra leucosticta Thuret, Pyropia leucosticta (Thuret) Neefus & J.Brodie', null, '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of Neopyropia leucosticta (Thuret) L.-E.Yang & J.Brodie 2020'),
('POL-NF-00707', 'Solanum quitense', 'Solanum hirsutissimum', 'quito orange, morelle de quito (FR)', '[{"part":"Fruit","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the fruit of Solanum quitense Kunth. It belongs to the Solanaceae Family.'),
('POL-NF-13885', 'Inositol', null, null, '[{"part":"Myoinositol","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"},{"part":"D-chiro-inositol","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns two isomers of Inositol: D-chiro-inositol and myoinositol obtained from non-novel plant-based sources.'),
('POL-NF-10461', 'Holothuria fuscogilva', null, 'Sea cucumber', '[{"part":"Whole","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'According to the conclusion reached by the French competent authority (General Directorate of food) in response to a request submitted pursuant to the requirements of Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2018/456 (https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en) on the procedural steps of the consultation process for determination of novel food status, Holothuria fuscogilva is considered novel in food .'),
('POL-NF-00164', 'Astragalus membranaceus', 'Astragalus membranaceus Fisch. ex Bunge', 'CZ: Kozinec blanitý', '[{"part":"Root and its alcoholic extracts, root extract ratio 2:1","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the roots of and alcoholic root extracts from Astragalus membranaceus. It is a plant that belongs to the family of Fabaceae. In addition, Astragalus membranaceus Fisch. ex Bunge radix extract ratio radix/extract 2:1 was subject to a request under Article 4 to the Italian competent authority. It was considered not novel in food supplements. The conclusion is published on the Commission''s webpage: https://food.ec.europa.eu/food-safety/novel-food/consultation-process-novel-food-s'),
('POL-NF-11262', 'Ligusticum striatum', 'Ligusticum chuanxiong S.H.Qiu, Y.Q.Zeng, K.Y.Pan, Y.C.Tang & J.M.Xu , Ligusticum wallichii Franch.', 'EN: Szechuan lovage', '[{"part":"Root/rhizome and its alcoholic extract","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the root/rhizome of and alcoholic root/rhizome extract from Ligusticum striatum DC'),
