('POL-NF-13142', 'Tagetes erecta', 'Tagetes erecta var. erecta, Tagetes ernstii H.Rob. & Nicolson', '(EN): African marigold, Aztec marigold, marigold.', '[{"part":"Aerial parts","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"},{"part":"Lutein, (meso-zeaxanthin) and zeaxanthin extract in an oil suspension","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD_SUPPLEMENTS"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the use of the aerial parts of Tagetes erecta flowers, as well as the extraction of lutein, meso-zeaxanthin and zeaxanthin from Tagetes erecta in a 15% oil suspension. Additionally, it covers the lutein and zeaxanthin exctract from Tagetes erecta in an oil suspension. Two requests regarding the use of lutein, zeaxanthin, and meso-zeaxanthin extracted from Tagetes erecta flowers in oil suspension were submitted to the Czech and German competent authorities under Article 4 of Re'),
