('POL-NF-14721', 'Dipteryx odorata (Aubl.) Forsyth f.', null, null, '[{"part":"seed","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the seeds of the tree Dipteryx odorata (commonly referred to as &quot;Brazilian teak&quot;), which are widely known as tonka beans . It has been demonstrated that there is a history of consumption of tonka beans in the EU. Therefore, tonka beans are considered not novel food.'),
