('POL-NF-16042', 'Allium roseum L.', null, null, '[{"part":"Leaves and bulbs","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the the plant species Allium roseum L. commonly known as pink garlic, viper garlic or snake garlic. A request concerning the leaves and bulbs of the plant species Allium roseum L. was submitted to the Spanish competent authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283. The outcome is also published on the following Commission''s link: https://food.ec.europa.eu/food-safety/novel-food/consultation-process-novel-food-status_en'),
('POL-NF-16043', 'Hyoseris radiata L.', null, null, '[{"part":"Leaves","status":"NOT_NOVEL_IN_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the the plant species Hyoseris radiata L. A request concerning the leaves of the plant species Hyoseris radiata L. was submitted to the Spanish competent authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283. The outcome is also published on the following Commission''s link: https://food.ec.europa.eu/food-safety/novel-food/consultation-process-novel-food-status_en'),
('POL-NF-17382', 'Cutaneotrichosporon oleaginosum', null, null, '[{"part":"Lipids from yeast","status":"NOT_YET_AUTHORISED_NOVEL_FOOD"}]'::jsonb, 'The entry concerns the lipids from yeast ( Cutaneotrichosporon oleaginosum) . A request concerning the lipids from yeast ( Cutaneotrichosporon oleaginosum) were submitted to the Czech competent authority under Article 4 of Regulation (EU) 2015/2283. The outcome is also published on the following Commission''s link https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/novel_food/consultation-process_en'),
